  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="861d751b-8710-4cbb-944f-3f864cc41942"><problem><para>
      <para>Here are the first two terms of a geometric sequence: 2, 4. What is the 5th term in the sequence?  </para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>32</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is 32. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
